@startuml
title State Diagram: Vehicle Entry (Entry Gate Controller)

' --- Vertical layout ---
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam ArrowColor Black

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> DetectVehicle : Vehicle arrives at entry lane

DetectVehicle --> CapturePlate : Sensor triggered / ANPR capture
CapturePlate --> ValidateIdentity : Plate number extracted

ValidateIdentity --> DenyEntry : Plate not recognized / blacklisted
ValidateIdentity --> CheckReservation : Plate valid

CheckReservation --> CheckAvailability : No reservation found
CheckReservation --> VerifyPayment : Reservation found

CheckAvailability --> DenyEntry : Parking lot full
CheckAvailability --> CreateSession : Spot available (walk-in)

CreateSession --> VerifyPayment : Session created

VerifyPayment --> RequestPayment : Payment missing / invalid
VerifyPayment --> CheckViolations : Payment valid

RequestPayment --> VerifyPayment : Payment completed
RequestPayment --> DenyEntry : Payment failed / timeout

CheckViolations --> DenyEntry : Unresolved violations exist
CheckViolations --> OpenGate : No violations

OpenGate --> RecordEntry : Gate opened successfully
RecordEntry --> UpdateOccupancy : Store entry time + assign spot
UpdateOccupancy --> [*]

DenyEntry --> AlertSecurity : Log denial + notify security
AlertSecurity --> [*]

@enduml
